Z||000000||x-thumpr-x||12-30-2001||10:10 PM||||How to get a fiero running for under $500 CANADIAN DOLLARS   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <BR>First you ned to find a real good deal!<P>Lets see:<P> CAR                        $  50<BR> Clutch release bearing     $  42<BR> Clutch fork                $ 125(installed)<BR> Front U-ball-joint         $  30<BR> U-control arm bushing      $  26<BR> Spark plugs                $  23<BR> Oil change (filter/fluid)  $  14<BR> Engine coolant             $  10<BR> Gas line repairs           $  13<BR> Altenator belt             $  20<BR> Nuts/ bolts replaced       $   5<BR> exhuast fix                $  30<BR> Tranny fluid               $   5<BR> Brake fluid                $   5<BR> __________________________________________<BR> Total                      $398(approx)<BR> emissions                    34(passed)<BR> Safety                       60(this week)<BR> _________________________________________<BR> Running car for            $492<P> UNDER $500. WOW  I paid 550 for the white GT which is the parts car for the black GT now. LOL<P>All I gotta do after is get my plates  and sticker.  just hoping it passes safety. <P>P.S. hope my math is accurate.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>     <BR>||||reg||6
